          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezra ogosomera abanto amachiiko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio abanto bonsi bakabwatana buna omonto oyomo, bagasangererekana ase eraaro agwo bosio bw’Egeita ki’Amache, bagateebia Ezra, oria orenge omworokia bw’amachiiko, arente Egetabu ki’Amachiko, a Musa, ayio Omonene aruete ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko rie ritang’ani, ri’omotienyi o gatano na kabere, Ezra Omokuani akarenta Egetabu ekio ki’Amachiko ase omoganda bwonsi, abasacha na abakungu, nabwo bonsi barenge konyara komanya aya baigwete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatenena bosio bw’Egeita ki’Amache, origereretie eraaro eria, na korwa mambia chuni goika mobaso gati akaba ogosomera abasacha na abakungu, na abwo bonsi barenge konyara komanya engencho y’amang’ana ayio. Abanto bonsi bagategerera koigwa ayarenge ase Egetabu ekio ki’Amachiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezra, omworokia bw’amachiiko, nigo atenenete igoro ase obotindiaro bwe chibao bwaroisetigwe ase emeremo eyio. Abatenenete ase ensemo yaye y’okorio nabwo aba: Matitia na Sema, Anaya na Uria, Hilikia na Maaseya. Na abatenenete ensemo yaye y’okobee, nabwo aba: Pedaya na Mishaeli, Malikia na Hasumu, Hasibadana na Zakaria, na Mesulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezra agatenena agwo igoro goetania abanto bonsi na akamaanora egetabu ase amasio abo. Ekero ayeigorete, abanto bonsi bagatenena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezra agatogia Omonene Nyasae bw’ogokumia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto bonsi bakarambora amaboko abo gochia igoro, bagateeba, “Amina! Amina!” Erio bagatung’ama bakaumama, bagasasiima Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bagatenena, kera oyomo aase aye, na Yesua na Bani, Serebia na Yamini, Akubu na Sabetai, Hodia na Maaseya, Kelita na Asaria, Yosabadi na Hanani, na Pelaya, Abalawi bakorokereria abanto amachiiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio bagasoma buya mono amachiiko a Nyasae korwa ase Egetabu keria. Naende bakaorokia engencho y’amang’ana ayio, erinde abanto bayaigwe na koyamanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto baigwete amang’ana ya ’machiko bakarera. Nehemia oyorenge omogabana obo, na Ezra, Omokuani na omworokia bw’amachiiko, na Abalawi abwo borokereretie abanto bonsi, bagateebia abanto, “Rituko eri ria reero nerichenu ase Omonene, Nyasae oino; ase ayio timobaisa korera, gose kobokia amagombo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Nehemia agateebia abanto, “Genda ase chinka chiaino, morie ebinoru biaino, monywe edivai enyansu, naende mobaatanere chindagera chiaino abwo batabwati, ekiagera rituko eri nerichenu ase Omonene oito. Timobaisa koba nomoichano, ekiagera omogooko Omonene noro chinguru chiaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalawi bagaeta ase egati y’abanto, bakabakiria, bagoteeba, “Kabe n’obotoereru, ekiagera rituko eri nerichenu, timobaisa koba nomoichano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bonsi bakagenda ase chinka chiabo, bakaba bakoria na konywa, bagaatanera chindagera chiabo baria batabwate, bakaba nomogooko, ekiagera konya bamanyire buya engencho y’amang’ana ayio bateebetigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoyega bw’Ebigutu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere, abateneneri be chiamate chiabo chionsi amo nabakuani na Abalawi, bagacha ase Ezra, omworokia bw’amariko, erinde beorokererie amang’ana ’amachiiko aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanyora amang’ana ariikire ase amachiiko ayio Omonene aruete ase Abaisraeli goetera ase Musa, ng’a Abaisraeli goika bamenye ase ebigutu ase Rituko Rinene ri’omotienyi o gatano na kabere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende ng’a ase engaki eyio goika bararie ase emechie yabo yonsi, na ase Yerusalemu, bateebie abanto bagende ase ebigoro barente chinsagia chi’emezeituni, ere ase emegondo na eyere ase orosana, na echi’emeadasi, na echi’emekendo, na echi’emete ende ere namato amange, erio baagachere ebigutu buna eriikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakarenta chinsagia echio, erio kera omonto akaagacha ekegutu igoro ase ekerama ki’enyomba yaye, gose ase ekeooreri kiaye, na ase chiraaro chi’enyomba ya Nyasae, na ase eraaro bosio bw’Egeita ki’Amache, na ase ey’Egeita ki’Efraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoganda bwonsi bw’abaanto bairanete korwa ase obosomba bakaagacha ebigutu bamenye imeo, ekiagera korwa ase engaki ya Yoshua, mosinto o Nuni, goika ase engaki eyio, Abaisraeli konya tibana gokora bo. Na bono bakaba nomogooko omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera rituko, korwa erie ritang’ani goikera eri’omoerio, Ezra akaba okobasomera Korea ase Egetabu keria kiarikire amachiiko a Nyasae. Abanto bakagenderera korenda Amatuko aria Amanene ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere, na ase rituko ria gatano na gatato bakaba nomosangererekano omonene bw’ogosasiima, buna yachikiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
